The -tags flag given twice: the standard flag package keeps the last value only, so "fast" is dropped.
Negative: exit 2, audit.go not loaded (same as tags_one_of_two). Documents that tags do not accumulate.
-- args --
-tags fast -tags audit internal/platform/audit.go:@audit
-- stdout --
-- stderr --
errtrace: $WORK/internal/platform/audit.go: file is not in any loaded package
-- exit --
2
